	image.28272665FBA6C75A.title: ""
	quest.009F2ED82DAF6550.quest_desc: [
		"Following the &cworld's demise&r, the oceans boiled away. In a desperate effort, &6we&r salvaged what we could from the dying seabed and carved new channels for the last of the water to flow."
		""
		"These &bfractured rivers&r, now little more than mud and weeds, hold the last remnants of marine life. It is there &6we&r relocated our great ships, now landlocked in the mire."
		""
		"Search the hulls of our sunken &eships&r. Within them, &6we&r left what treasures we could salvage: &dPrismarine&r, &dSponges&r, and perhaps even a &dHeart of the Sea&r."
	]
	quest.009F2ED82DAF6550.title: "Ancient Note 3"
	quest.038BDAC8D8FEDA89.quest_desc: [
		"Our technology was primitive, yet it always sufficed. However, the world you have encountered is full of &cnew dangers&r."
		""
		"In my remaining time, &6I&r will work on &dnew technologies&r. Along with all &drelics of my ancestors&r, &6I&r will place them in &echests,&r scattered all over the world so you can find them under any conditions."
		""
		"Take them and start a new era."
	]
	quest.038BDAC8D8FEDA89.title: "Ancient Note 4"
	quest.0AD3BDD9A9F0DD3C.quest_desc: [
		"You're probably wondering how all of this came about. To be honest, &6we&r don't quite know yet either."
		""
		"Some &6builders&r were in the midst of exploring a &enew dimension&r, which by now is nothing new for &6us&r. However, &6we&r never saw them again. Their last reports were about &ccreatures stronger than the Wither&r and &cmore cunning than the Ender Dragon&r."
		""
		"Whatever occurred in the other &5dimension&r ended up &cdamaging our own&r. And now &6we&r live in a &cshattered overworld&r, full of &cwildfires like the Nether&r, and &6our&r air is &crunning thin&r."
	]
	quest.0AD3BDD9A9F0DD3C.title: "Ancient Note 5"
	quest.20C0E7DCB3D00222.quest_desc: [
		"t has been a week now since the &cworld shattered&r. With the help of copper, iron, gold, and other materials, &6I&r was able to create new alloys. The Armorer crafted &dhelmets from turtle shells&r, allowing &6us&r to &ebreathe a bit better again&r."
		""
		"Currently, &6I'm&r working on a so-called &dME storage system&r; it digitizes items. Quite compact! It eases things for &6us&r during this time, but it's not fully refined yet."
		""
		"Meanwhile, the &6Toolsmith&r has crafted grappling hooks from pickaxes, and the &6Weaponsmith&r has forged an entire arsenal of new swords. Tomorrow, they will present new chests, barrels, and shields to &6us&r."
		""
		"&6We&r are doing everything to prepare ourselves against &cnew dangers in the Nether and the End&r; reports speak of &ceven stronger creatures&r. Where will all of this &5End&r?"
	]
	quest.20C0E7DCB3D00222.title: "Ancient Note 6"
	quest.5EA2A20BB8A6AEE5.quest_desc: [
		"With the help of a totem, &6we&r were able to craft the &dTotem of Void Undying&r today."
		""
		"It has already rescued &6me&r from unsuccessful grappling hook maneuvers. This item is &eessential for survival here&r."
	]
	quest.5EA2A20BB8A6AEE5.title: "Ancient Note 1"
	quest.7A00249B1CC9C705.quest_desc: [
		"I trust this note finds the right recipient..."
		""
		"In a time when the overworld was blank, &6we builders&r rose. With artistry and mastery, we built soaring towers as monuments to our craft."
		""
		"We engineered &dGliders&r, simple marvels of &eleather, paper, and metal&r, granting the gift of flight. Amidst the devastation, the specific techniques were lost. The last of our original &dGliders&r now rest within the lonely towers."
		""
		"Seek out these &dGliders&r. Study their design, master their use, and take to the skies. Overcome this &cravaged world&r and &eRebuild It&r."
	]
	quest.7A00249B1CC9C705.title: "Ancient Note 2"
}
